  m_text: 'Emission makes a surface show its own colour, even in the dark.


    <b>Predict:</b> Does the sign light the white wall and the floor around it?


    <b>Try:</b> Add a Point Light in front of the sign (GameObject > Light > Point Light). Give it the sign''s colour and a small range.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Lit shader, Emission</color></size>'
