  m_text: 'Metallic sets metal (1) or non-metal (0). Smoothness sets how sharp the reflection is, from matte (0) to mirror (1).


    <b>Predict:</b> All four spheres have the same base colour. Which are metal? Which are smooth?


    <b>Try:</b> Check each material. Then turn sphere 3 into wet asphalt: base colour 58, metallic 0, smoothness 0.9.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Lit shader, Metallic and smoothness</color></size>'
