  m_text: 'A smooth surface reflects a picture of its surroundings. Away from any Reflection Probe, it reflects the scene''s general picture.


    <b>Predict:</b> Both spheres use the same material. Does the one in the box reflect the red walls?


    <b>Try:</b> Add a Reflection Probe inside the box (GameObject > Light > Reflection Probe). Fit its box to the room, set Type to Baked and click Bake.'
